----- stdout -----
Generate configured clients for the current Pina program.

Discovers the project, refreshes its IDL, and generates only the selected client ecosystems. Repeat --client to override Pina.toml. Rust-only generation does not invoke Node.js.

Usage: pina generate [OPTIONS]

Options:
  -p, --project <DIR>
          Directory inside the project to discover. Defaults to the current directory

      --client <LANGUAGE>
          Client ecosystem to generate. Repeat to override Pina.toml
          
          [possible values: rust, typescript, dart]

  -o, --output <DIR>
          Override the configured client output directory

      --npx <COMMAND>
          Executable used to invoke JavaScript or Dart renderers. Defaults to npx

  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')

Examples:
  pina generate
  pina generate --client rust
  pina generate --client typescript --client dart
  pina generate --project ./programs/counter --output ./generated

Configuration:
  [clients]
  output = "clients"
  languages = ["rust", "typescript"]

